{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlppwa6rdiw0","created":1790473533685,"text":"心血管药理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptv9z0z8o0","created":1790484739292,"text":"抗心律失常药\nAntiarrhythmic Drugs"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptvezb00g0","created":1790484750193,"text":"心律失常发生的电生理机制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptvjnfwqw0","created":1790484760360,"text":"心律失常：心脏冲动、传导或者激动次序发生异常，\n引起心跳频率或节律发生紊乱"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptvuwdfyo0","created":1790484784844,"text":"心肌细胞电生理学基础","layout_right_offset":{"x":0,"y":-33}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptw33jyp40","created":1790484802693,"text":"心脏电活动的离子基础：\nNa+、K+、Ca2+的跨膜转运"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptwa14uwo0","created":1790484817784,"text":"兴奋期与不应期"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptwbxyme80","created":1790484821946,"text":"动作电位时程APD"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptwjsypwg0","created":1790484839058,"text":"从动作电位去极化起始，\n到复极化回到静息电位水平的总时间"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptwqd6c3s0","created":1790484853341,"text":"绝对不应期ARP"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptwt1d16o0","created":1790484859157,"text":"钠通道完全处于失活状态，\n无法再次开放"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptwwlztuo0","created":1790484866935,"text":"有效不应期ERP"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptx1jgjlc0","created":1790484877665,"text":"足够强刺激也只能产生局部电位，\n不能产生可传导的动作电位"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptxbpmdpc0","created":1790484899806,"text":"大部分 Na⁺通道仍处于失活状态，仅少量恢复，\n不足以形成再生性去极化。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptxkfxqko0","created":1790484918811,"text":"相对不应期RRP"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptxn7914w0","created":1790484924816,"text":"ERP 结束后，膜电位从 - 60mV 恢复至静息电位\n（约 - 80 ~ -90mV）的阶段"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptxv0uwl40","created":1790484941844,"text":"部分钠通道已经复活，\n但还没有全部回到备用状态"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlpty7cvr7k0","created":1790484968692,"text":"发生机制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptyew9c2g0","created":1790484985101,"text":"自律性升高"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptyhehk5s0","created":1790484990557,"text":"自律细胞自律性升高"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptyk63tgg0","created":1790484996581,"text":"交感活性增加"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptylseh940","created":1790485000106,"text":"低血钾"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptysa2zug0","created":1790485014236,"text":"心肌细胞受到机械牵张"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptyxsfdzc0","created":1790485026229,"text":"非自律细胞异常自律性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptz3k809s0","created":1790485038793,"text":"缺血缺氧可使非自律心肌细胞出现异常自律性，这种异常兴奋向周围组织扩布可引起心律失常"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptz7twk4g0","created":1790485048086,"text":"后除极：动作电位复极时\n产生的一个提前除极"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlptzf9g2cg0","created":1790485064263,"text":"早后除极EAD"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptzgjwviw0","created":1790485067073,"text":"迟后除极DAD"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlptzo79dc80","created":1790485083722,"text":"抗心律失常药的基本作用和分类"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptzwoel400","created":1790485102173,"text":"代表药物"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlptzyydwbs0","created":1790485107130,"text":"致心律失常作用"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}